，紹與術不協，術遣賁攻破昂於陰陵。術表賁領豫州刺史，轉丹楊都尉，行征虜將軍，討平山越。為揚州刺史劉繇所迫逐，因將士眾還住歷陽。頃之，術復使賁與吳景共擊樊能、張英等，未能拔。及策東渡，助賁、景破英、能等，遂進擊劉繇。繇走豫章。策遣賁、景還壽春報術，值術僭號，署置百官。除賁九江太守。賁不就，棄妻孥還江南。時策已平吳、會二郡，賁與策征廬江太守劉勳、江夏太守黃祖，軍旋，聞繇病死，過定豫章，上賁領太守，後封都亭侯。建安十三年，使者劉隱奉詔拜賁為征虜將軍，領郡如故。在官十一年卒。子鄰嗣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"孫賁","kind":"person","person_id":"8jx_b5c_t2q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"伯陽","kind":"person","person_id":"8jx_b5c_t2q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"羌","kind":"person","person_id":"km0_joi_0ag","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0011","surface":"聖〔臺〕","start":11,"end":15,"kind":"person","person_id":"km0_joi_0ag","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"賁","kind":"person","person_id":"8jx_b5c_t2q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"輔","kind":"person","person_id":"e8h_aeo_zy8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"賁","kind":"person","person_id":"8jx_b5c_t2q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-ben:line032:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},